description.desc:
Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Launch up to 4 Slashes forward, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack]</color> Stage 4 is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Drawn Stance]</color>;

While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Sky Patrol Gunstance]</color> with available <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color> charges, hold <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to activate:
Activates the corresponding <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color> based on the current stage, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color> has three stages. Each activation advances the stage count. After activating Stage 3 of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color>, the stage count resets;
When Sigrid takes a hit from an enemy while charging her Stance during Stage 1 or 2 of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color>, she blocks with her shield. A successful Block negates the incoming DMG, refreshes the <color=#FFFFFF>[Sky Patrol Gunstance]</color> state, and grants one <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color> charge. After a successful Block, press 【Basic Attack】 to activate <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color> at the corresponding stage;
<color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color> used after <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Piercing Frost Tip]</color> retains the current stage count of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Piercing Frost Tip]</color>;
DMG taken during this skill is reduced by 60%;
Anti-Interrupt level is increased during this skill;
Sigrid is invulnerable during Stage 3 of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract]</color>.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Evade> to activate:
A quick dash dodge;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> during a <color=#FFFFFF>Perfect Dodge</color> to activate:
Condenses ice at the spear tip to unleash a powerful counter against enemies ahead, dealing <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
A <color=#FFFFFF>Dodge Counter: Parting Shot</color> used after <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Frostbite Spearhead</color> retains the number of stages of <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Frostbite Spearhead</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Draw Stance</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Energy is sufficient and not in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Sky-Sweeping Spear Stance]</color> state, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Launch a powerful series of forward thrusts, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
If Sigrid is hit by an enemy attack during the thrusts, she will Block with her shield. A successful Block negates the incoming attack's DMG, refreshes the <color=#FFFFFF>[Sky-Sweeping Spear Stance]</color> state, and grants one opportunity to activate <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Spear-Draw Stance]</color>. After a successful Block, press [Basic Attack] to activate the corresponding stage of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Spear-Draw Stance]</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Spear-Draw Stance]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Energy is sufficient and in the <color=#FFFFFF>[Sky-Patrol Stance]</color> state, press <IconMap:Icon_SpecialReady> to activate:
Launch a powerful series of forward lunge thrusts, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
When hit by an enemy attack during the lunge thrusts, Sigrid uses her shield to Block. If the Block is successful, the incoming attack DMG is negated, the <color=#FFFFFF>[Sky-Patrol Stance]</color> state is refreshed, and one opportunity to activate <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Gunlock Form]</color> is granted. Press【Basic Attack】after a successful Block to activate the corresponding sequence of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Gunlock Form]</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Draw Form]</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When a <color=#FFFFFF>Chain Attack</color> is triggered, select the character to activate:
Launch a powerful Pierce against enemies ahead, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
Gain 1 stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color>. Each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[Temper]</color> increases the DMG dealt by subsequent <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract Stance]</color> by 25%, lasting 50s;
When this skill hits an Elite or Boss-Rank enemy in a Stunned state for the first time, the current <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract Stance]</color> stage count is recorded and reset, entering <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> state. This effect can trigger at most once per Stun period;
While in <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> state, <color=#FFFFFF>[Aerial Gun Stance]</color> duration does not decrease, and holding <IconMap:Icon_Normal> allows continuous use of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract Stance]</color> Stages 1 through 3;
After using <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract Stance]</color> Stage 3, <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> state ends and the <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract Stance]</color> stage count is restored;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>[Draw Stance]</color>;
During <color=#FFFFFF>[Formation Break]</color> state, <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Retract Stance]</color> hitting Stunned enemies will not open a Chain Attack window;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

When Decibel Rating is at <color=#FFFFFF>Maximum</color>, press <IconMap:Icon_UltimateReady> to activate:
Channels the power of extreme cold to unleash a devastating series of dashes forward, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Draw</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

Press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> after a <color=#FFFFFF>Defensive Assist</color> to activate:
Swing the spear upward, then slam it down with a heavy attack, dealing massive <color=#98EFF0>Ice DMG</color>;
This skill is considered a <color=#FFFFFF>Spear Draw Stance</color>;
Character is invulnerable while using this skill.

